; The grip: how a sword sits in a fist. The socket in the hero says only where the
; fist is, so the pose belongs here — and only the X euler is used, because X is
; the one axis a grip can lean about and still mirror into the other hand
; unchanged. 16 degrees forward, which is what lifts the blade clear of the hood
; instead of hiding it behind one. Authored in assets/source/hero_kit.py as GRIP.

